/p><p begin="0:20.623" end="0:24.705" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:20.623" end="0:21.514">爱</span> <span begin="0:22.204" end="0:22.535">原</span><span begin="0:22.535" end="0:22.892">来如</span><span begin="0:22.892" end="0:23.232">此</span><span begin="0:23.232" end="0:23.764">脆</span><span begin="0:23.764" end="0:24.705">弱</span></p><p begin="0:25.578" end="0:27.565" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:25.578" end="0:25.899">掉</span><span begin="0:25.899" end="0:26.298">入深</span><span begin="0:26.298" end="0:27.028">海的</span><span begin="0:27.028" end="0:27.565">心</span></p><p begin="0:27.565" end="0:32.451" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:27.565" end="0:28.394">我却</span><span begin="0:28.394" end="0:28.684">不</span><span begin="0:28.684" end="0:29.264">想</span><span begin="0:29.264" end="0:29.544">被</span><span begin="0:29.544" end="0:30.543">谁拯</span><span begin="0:30.543" end="0:32.451">救</span></p></div><div begin="0:33.391" end="0:59.715" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="0:33.391" end="0:36.631" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:33.391" end="0:33.710">堆</span><span begin="0:33.710" end="0:33.819">积</span><span begin="0:33.819" end="0:34.278">的</span><span begin="0:34.278" end="0:35.080">回忆</span> <span begin="0:35.080" end="0:35.590">泛黄</span><span begin="0:35.590" end="0:35.909">的</span><span begin="0:35.909" end="0:36.068">讯</span><span begin="0:36.377" end="0:36.631">息</span></p><p begin="0:36.841" end="0:41.560" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:36.841" end="0:37.200">好多</span><span begin="0:37.200" end="0:38.181">不容</span><span begin="0:38.181" end="0:38.496">易</span> <span begin="0:38.541" end="0:38.902">失</span><span begin="0:38.902" end="0:39.453">去</span><span begin="0:39.453" end="0:40.122">得太</span><span begin="0:40.122" end="0:40.691">轻</span><span begin="0:40.691" end="0:41.560">易</span></p><p begin="0:42.116" end="0:45.798" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:42.116" end="0:42.305">还</span><span begin="0:42.305" end="0:43.625">在措手</span><span begin="0:43.625" end="0:43.936">不</span><span begin="0:43.936" end="0:45.798">及</span></p><p begin="0:46.909" end="0:50.209" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:46.909" end="0:47.199">在</span><span begin="0:47.199" end="0:47.357">每</span><span begin="0:47.357" end="0:48.269">个夜</span><span begin="0:48.269" end="0:48.469">里</span> <span begin="0:48.609" end="0:49.088">我试</span><span begin="0:49.088" end="0:49.988">着抽</span><span begin="0:49.988" end="0:50.209">离</span></p><p begin="0:50.299" end="0:55.924" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:50.299" end="0:50.588">却</span><span begin="0:50.588" end="0:50.766">又</span><span begin="0:50.766" end="0:51.675">不断</span><span begin="0:51.675" end="0:52.426">的 从</span><span begin="0:52.426" end="0:53.736">睡梦里</span><span begin="0:53.736" end="0:54.115">惊</span><span begin="0:54.115" end="0:55.924">醒</span></p><p begin="0:55.635" end="0:59.715" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:55.635" end="0:55.793">该</span><span begin="0:55.793" end="0:57.494">怎么不想</span><span begin="0:57.494" end="0:59.715">起</span></p></div><div begin="1:00.017" end="1:29.454" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:00.017" end="1:03.227" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:00.017" end="1:00.165">你</span><span begin="1:00.165" end="1:00.494">没</span><span begin="1:00.494" end="1:00.698">等</span><span begin="1:00.698" end="1:01.017">我</span><span begin="1:01.017" end="1:01.614">去</span><span begin="1:01.614" end="1:01.887">的</span><span begin="1:01.887" end="1:02.395">旧</span><span begin="1:02.395" end="1:02.577">金</span><span begin="1:02.577" end="1:03.227">山</span></p><p begin="1:03.399" end="1:06.629" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.399" end="1:03.508">你</span><span begin="1:03.508" end="1:03.887">没</span><span begin="1:03.887" end="1:04.388">陪我</span><span begin="1:04.388" end="1:05.401">牵手</span><span begin="1:05.401" end="1:06.015">的圣</span><span begin="1:06.015" end="1:06.629">诞</span></p><p begin="1:06.806" end="1:10.106" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:06.806" end="1:07.243">而我</span><span begin="1:07.243" end="1:07.472">却</span><span begin="1:07.472" end="1:08.264">把你</span><span begin="1:08.264" end="1:08.514">随</span><span begin="1:08.514" end="1:08.977">口</span><span begin="1:08.977" end="1:09.325">的</span><span begin="1:09.325" end="1:10.106">话</span></p><p begin="1:10.430" end="1:12.789" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:10.430" end="1:10.847">一人</span><span begin="1:10.847" end="1:11.167">承</span><span begin="1:11.167" end="1:12.789">担</span></p><p begin="1:13.558" end="1:16.729" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.558" end="1:14.578">我被动的</span><span begin="1:14.578" end="1:15.848">接受失</span><span begin="1:15.848" end="1:16.087">落</span><span begin="1:16.087" end="1:16.729">感</span></p><p begin="1:16.982" end="1:20.439" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:16.982" end="1:17.607">那一句</span><span begin="1:17.607" end="1:17.938">没</span><span begin="1:17.938" end="1:18.420">说</span><span begin="1:18.420" end="1:18.678">出</span><span begin="1:18.678" end="1:19.620">的晚</span><span begin="1:19.620" end="1:20.439">安</span></p><p begin="1:20.758" end="1:25.921" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:20.758" end="1:21.021">我</span><span begin="1:21.021" end="1:21.218">还</span><span begin="1:21.218" end="1:21.838">在</span><span begin="1:21.838" end="1:22.060">对</span><span begin="1:22.060" end="1:22.639">话</span><span begin="1:22.639" end="1:22.921">框</span><span begin="1:22.921" end="1:23.567">里</span><span begin="1:23.567" end="1:24.071">打了</span><span begin="1:24.071" end="1:24.519">又</span><span begin="1:24.519" end="1:25.921">删</span></p><p begin="1:26.277" end="1:29.454" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:26.277" end="1:26.865">算</span><span begin="1:26.865" end="1:27.035">不</span><span begin="1:27.035" end="1:27.637">算</span><span begin="1:27.637" end="1:28.092">难</span><span begin="1:28.092" end="1:29.454">堪</span></p></div><div begin="1:27.589" end="1:55.025" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:27.589" end="1:29.249" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.589" end="1:28.048">手上</span><span begin="1:28.208" end="1:28.509">握着</span><span begin="1:28.509" end="1:28.969">你家钥</span><span begin="1:28.969" end="1:29.249">匙</span></p><p begin="1:29.428" end="1:30.959" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:29.428" end="1:29.888">门口</span><span begin="1:29.888" end="1:30.158">坐了</span><span begin="1:30.158" end="1:30.457">几个</span><span begin="1:30.457" end="1:30.959">小时</span></p><p begin="1:31.106" end="1:32.572" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.106" end="1:31.456">还是</span><span begin="1:31.456" end="1:31.844">没有</span><span begin="1:31.844" end="1:32.144">办法</span><span begin="1:32.144" end="1:32.572">调适</span></p><p begin="1:32.582" end="1:34.264" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.582" end="1:32.852">对</span><span begin="1:32.852" end="1:33.140">你莫</span><span begin="1:33.140" end="1:33.540">名的</span><span begin="1:33.540" end="1:33.860">那种</span><span begin="1:33.860" end="1:34.264">偏执</span></p><p begin="1:34.198" end="1:36.523" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.198" end="1:34.734">还记</span><span begin="1:34.734" end="1:34.834">得</span><span begin="1:34.834" end="1:35.283">我</span><span begin="1:35.283" end="1:35.683">们的</span><span begin="1:35.683" end="1:36.523">纪念日</span></p><p begin="1:36.589" end="1:37.749" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:36.589" end="1:36.929">记得</span><span begin="1:36.929" end="1:37.308">你</span><span begin="1:37.308" end="1:37.477">固</span><span begin="1:37.477" end="1:37.749">执</span></p><p begin="1:37.759" end="1:39.819" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.759" end="1:37.898">还</span><span begin="1:37.898" end="1:38.579">记得你</span><span begin="1:38.738" end="1:38.999">不</span><span begin="1:38.999" end="1:39.136">爱</span><span begin="1:39.136" end="1:39.819">盖被子</span></p><p begin="1:39.847" end="1:41.325" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.847" end="1:40.615">还记得你</span><span begin="1:40.615" end="1:40.865">挑</span><span begin="1:40.865" end="1:41.325">食</span></p><p begin="1:41.011" end="1:42.936" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:41.011" end="1:42.358">从开头就知道</span><span begin="1:42.358" end="1:42.752">不</span><span begin="1:42.752" end="1:42.936">合适</span></p><p begin="1:42.946" end="1:44.615" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:42.946" end="1:44.615">还是走过五个四季</span></p><p begin="1:44.625" end="1:46.301" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:44.625" end="1:45.336">曾经爱</span><span begin="1:45.336" end="1:45.453">得</span><span begin="1:45.453" end="1:45.884">不可</span><span begin="1:45.884" end="1:46.123">思</span><span begin="1:46.123" end="1:46.301">议</span></p><p begin="1:46.309" end="1:47.933" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:46.309" end="1:47.449">现在却都不</span><span begin="1:47.449" end="1:47.577">合</span><span begin="1:47.577" end="1:47.933">时宜</span></p><p begin="1:47.933" end="1:50.104" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:47.933" end="1:47.997">以</span><span begin="1:47.997" end="1:48.297">后你</span><span begin="1:48.297" end="1:49.657">来电的铃</span><span begin="1:49.657" end="1:50.104">声</span></p><p begin="1:50.122" end="1:51.452" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:50.122" end="1:50.414">不</span><span begin="1:50.414" end="1:50.993">会再响</span><span begin="1:50.993" end="1:51.452">起</span></p><p begin="1:51.190" end="1:53.029" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:51.190" end="1:51.609">后来</span><span begin="1:51.609" end="1:52.157">遇见了</span><span begin="1:52.157" end="1:52.477">新</span><span begin="1:52.477" end="1:52.678">的</span><span begin="1:52.678" end="1:53.029